		},
		{
			"speaker": "工匠",
			"text": "三！"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（话音刚落，十根手指一起在脚心上飞快地挠了起来）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "worker",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "hand",
